"Images are fitted to A4 or Letter pages, turned to landscape when wide." = "图片按比例放入 A4 或 Letter 页面，横向图片使用横向页面。";
"New PDF from Images…" = "从图片新建 PDF…";
"The text of all pages, with fonts and sizes in RTF and Word. The page layout isn’t kept." = "导出全部页面的文字；RTF 与 Word 保留字体与字号，不保留页面版式。";
"This document doesn’t allow copying its content, so its text can’t be exported." = "此文稿不允许拷贝内容，因此不能导出文字。";

/* Text recognition */
"Recognize Text…" = "识别文字…";
"Recognize Text" = "识别文字";
"Recognize" = "识别";
"The chosen pages already have text." = "所选页面已经有文字。";
"Recognized text on %ld pages." = "已识别 %ld 页的文字。";
"Recognized text on %ld of %ld pages." = "共 %2$ld 页，其中 %1$ld 页识别出文字。";
"Makes scanned pages searchable: the text found is added to the page as an invisible layer, and the page looks the same." = "让扫描页面可以搜索：识别出的文字作为不可见的文字层加入页面，页面外观不变。";
"Reading page %ld of %ld…" = "正在识别第 %ld 页（共 %ld 页）…";
"Skip pages that already have text" = "跳过已有文字的页面";
"Chinese, English, Japanese and Korean are recognized. Reading takes about a second a page." = "可识别中文、英文、日文与韩文。每页约需 1 秒。";

/* Redaction */
"Redact" = "涂黑";
"Mark for Redaction" = "标记涂黑";
"Mark Selection for Redaction" = "标记所选文字以涂黑";
"Apply Redactions…" = "应用涂黑…";
"Apply Redactions" = "应用涂黑";
"Select the text to redact first." = "请先选择要涂黑的文字。";
"Mark the areas to redact first, with the Redact tool or by selecting text." = "请先用“涂黑”工具或选择文字来标记要涂黑的区域。";
"Apply %ld redactions on %ld pages?" = "在 %2$ld 页上应用 %1$ld 处涂黑？";
"What is under the marked areas is removed for good once the document is saved. The pages become images; annotations over the areas are removed." = "存储后，标记区域下的内容将被永久删除。这些页面会变为图像；与标记区域重叠的批注也会被移除。";
"Recognize the remaining text, so the pages stay searchable" = "识别其余文字，使页面仍可搜索";
"Redacted %ld pages. Save to make it permanent." = "已涂黑 %ld 页。存储后才会永久生效。";
"Applying Redactions" = "正在应用涂黑";
"Page %ld of %ld…" = "第 %ld 页（共 %ld 页）…";
"Redaction Mark" = "涂黑标记";
